summary:
  What the cache keeps about a picture says "track" whatever it was.

history:
  The cache held an address and a time. A song that comes round again is
  painted from it without a lookup, so a stand-in found once was the song's
  cover for the rest of the session, on the panel and on the lock screen.
  The entry carries the kind now. This mutant files every picture as the
  track.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
              _artCache[cacheKey] = { "url": url || "", "t": Date.now(), "kind": kind };

replace:
              _artCache[cacheKey] = { "url": url || "", "t": Date.now(), "kind": url ? "track" : "" };

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_another_single_of_the_artist_is_another_release_and_never_the_songs_cover.
  Line-neutral.
